    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">PRN222 · Chapter 4 · Session 17</span>\n<h2>Session 17 — Chapter 03: Dependency Injection in .NET (cont.)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13892 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">PRN222 · Chương 4 · Buổi 17</span>\n<h2>Buổi 17 — Chapter 03: Dependency Injection in .NET (cont.)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13892 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T: Constructivism Method</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T: Constructivism Method</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Chapter 03: Dependency Injection in .NET (cont.)</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p><a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/core/extensions/dependency-injection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/core/extensions/dependency-injection</a><br><br><a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/aspnet/core/fundamentals/dependency-injection?view=aspnetcore-8.3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/aspnet/core/fundamentals/dependency-injection?view=aspnetcore-8.3</a></p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>- Read the slide, related reference documents<br>- Do exercises<br>- Self practice</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
